00:13:27,380 --> 00:13:28,360
He stays his hand.

251
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:34,440
That is a high-stress situation, rife with imponderables, in which Paul might have thought

252
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:37,920
it was in his interest to let the jailer just go ahead, right?

253
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:40,100
He would then be free.

254
00:13:40,100 --> 00:13:41,040
He could wander off.

255
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:41,700
He wouldn't be in prison.

256
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:43,160
Michelle talked about this a few weeks ago.

