259
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:50,380
But he didn't even think twice.

260
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:54,380
Boldly, he obeyed Christ's command to lay down his life in service of discipleship.

261
00:13:54,380 --> 00:13:55,260
All right?

