00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,780
usually, right?

277
00:14:38,780 --> 00:14:42,300
You're not quite sure, but you're wanting to say you are the thing you're afraid you're

278
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:42,620
not.

279
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,280
You're not respecting me.

280
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:46,240
I don't know if you should be, but you're not doing it.

281
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:50,280
And that's not what Paul does in any of this story.

282
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:54,940
Boldness, true unapologetic boldness that Paul had and that models for us and that we

283
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:59,880
hope to cultivate in everybody in this church is born out of confidence and a bedrock certainty.

284
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,000
Right?

285
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:07,420
When you go forth from this church, you will never, to speak for Jesus, it will never be

286
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:08,720
because you have a script to recite.

287
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:11,880
It'll never be because you have a set of tasks to complete or a quota to meet.

288
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:17,480
It'll be because you've experienced Christ here and you're certain both of his reality

