00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:19,520
and the need for the world's reconciliation to him.

290
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:22,680
We wouldn't ask you to assert your rightness.

291
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,540
You're out there to assert his righteousness.

292
00:15:24,540 --> 00:15:28,960
So to act boldly like Paul did, we have to have that confidence in the living and written

293
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,400
word that we say we value, right?

294
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:33,940
From whence comes that confidence, right?

295
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,220
I'd love to have that.

296
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:38,080
Boldness comes from certainty.

297
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:40,500
Boldness comes from confidence.

298
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:41,620
Confidence comes from certainty.

